        "id": 223951,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-26T01:53:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Medico is one of the few ‘HP at a certain point/take a certain ammount of damage’ unlocks that I find you really don’t need to turn other heroes against the target to fufill the needed requirements.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same here.&nbsp; Honestly you can play the guy normally in any long game or slugfest game and get it pretty easily.&nbsp; Akash, Skinwalker Gloomy, and Progeny are all pretty good for this.&nbsp; Him blowing up ReVolt is also pretty easy, you just need a way to get Glamour off the feild if she shows up.</p>",
